  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <div class="page-wrapper">

      <section class="page-header animate">
        <h1>Global Energy Flow 2022</h1>
        <p>A Sankey diagram tracing energy from 9 primary sources through 4 transformation stages to 5 end-use sectors. All values in exajoules (EJ). Based on approximate 2022 global energy balance.</p>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-badge"><strong>Source:</strong> IEA / LLNL-style estimates</span>
          <span class="meta-badge"><strong>Year:</strong> 2022 (approximate)</span>
          <span class="meta-badge"><strong>Unit:</strong> Exajoules (EJ)</span>
          <span class="meta-badge"><strong>Nodes:</strong> 19 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Flows:</strong> 27</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="kpi-row animate delay-1" aria-label="Key energy statistics">
        <div class="kpi-card kpi-waste">
          <div class="kpi-value" data-count="167" data-suffix=" EJ">167 EJ</div>
          <div class="kpi-label">Total Waste / Rejected Heat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card kpi-fossil">
          <div class="kpi-value" data-count="469" data-suffix=" EJ">469 EJ</div>
          <div class="kpi-label">Fossil Fuel Input (Oil + Coal + Gas)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card kpi-renewable">
          <div class="kpi-value" data-count="74" data-suffix=" EJ">74 EJ</div>
          <div class="kpi-label">Renewable Input (excl. Nuclear)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
          <div class="kpi-value" data-count="153" data-suffix=" EJ">153 EJ</div>
          <div class="kpi-label">Transport End-Use (largest sector)</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sankey-section animate delay-2">
        <div class="sankey-header">
          <div class="sankey-title">Energy Flow: Sources → Transformation → End Use</div>
          <div class="sankey-subtitle">Band width proportional to energy in EJ. Hover over flows to inspect values.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sankey-wrapper">
          <div role="img" aria-label="Sankey diagram showing global energy flows from 9 primary sources through 4 transformation processes to 5 end-use sectors and waste heat. Total energy ~600 EJ with 167 EJ as waste heat.">
            <svg id="sankeyChart"></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="legend-section" data-reveal aria-label="Color legend">
        <div class="legend-grid">
          <div class="legend-group">
            <div class="legend-group-title">Primary Energy Sources</div>
